{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:13dbb870077be2c6","name":"Officer Talent Trees","source":{"id":"source:reference-13dbb870077be2c6","title":"Officer Talent Trees","revision":18393,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:03:52Z","sha256":"3d647f420baa022d161220ceddbbfce78b3d94f765a115e7c12b2473f3c271a1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18393","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Officer%20Talent%20Trees&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-13dbb870077be2c6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Officer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officer","referenceId":"reference:192135a8adabe174"}," gains an additional Officer Talent. An ",{"tag":"a","children":["Officer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officer","referenceId":"reference:192135a8adabe174"}," may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from any of the following Officer Talent Trees they wish, but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen Officer Talent. No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Commando Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Commando_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:1ccfc7af27121192"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You use advanced combat tactics to take down enemies quickly, shield your comrades, and endure whatever challenges are thrown your way.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Leadership Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Leadership_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:a51a0918ead13923"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["A born leader, you know how to take charge and lead your companions and followers to success.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military Tactics Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military_Tactics_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:0d078e46ad580c9c"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Officers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officers"}," study old battles, looking for historical examples of good military tactics. You are an expert at leading troops into battle, and using the battlefield to your advantage.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Naval Officer Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naval_Officer_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:580a65fd8e1afe28"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You are skilled at commanding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," and small fleets.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Fugitive Commander Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fugitive_Commander_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:81a67d0a64985b62"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["When a fighting force is outmanned, outgunned, and constantly on the run, only the skill and acumen of talented ",{"tag":"a","children":["Officers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officers"}," can keep morale high and prevent desertion or surrender. Fugitive Commanders are skilled in the art of deceiving and eluding their pursuers.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebel Recruiter Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebel_Recruiter_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:5ea7201749b07bc6"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have learned that many enemies can be considered potential allies instead. You can recognize the telltale signs of a potential ally, and, rather than killing your enemy, you can bring him or her over to your side.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
